<title>GERMANY: Moderate rise in Dyckerhoff 9-month sales.</title>
<headline>Moderate rise in Dyckerhoff 9-month sales.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to the end of September 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,860   vs 1,854</p>
<p>    Group investments			  308     vs 234</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    Plant and equipment			127     vs 171</p>
<p>    Financial investments		    181     vs 63</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Dyckerhoff AG. During the nine-month period, Dyckerhoff spent 181 million marks acquiring a stake in the Polish cement group Nowiny.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
